# ===== Secrets / Env =====
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
# 示例文件必须只含占位符；两个前端环境文件是已跟踪的非秘密构建配置。
!**/.env.example
!frontend/.env.development
!frontend/.env.production

# ===== 证书 / 凭据 =====
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*credentials*.json

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.db
**/*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.duckdb
backend/*.log
backend_e2e*.log

# ===== Node / Frontend =====
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
dist/

# ===== 运行时数据（通过 volume 持久化，不进镜像） =====
data/
cache/
logs/
coverage/
**/chroma_db/
**/uploads/
**/backups/

# ===== 本地缓存 / 工具 / 日志 =====
.coverage
.pytest_cache/
.idea/
.workbuddy/
.codebuddy/
.playwright-cli/
**/*.log
**/*.err

# ===== 业务文件（构建不需要） =====
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.xlsm

# ===== 测试 / 文档 / 工具 =====
test/
tests/
test-reports/
docs/
*.log
*.ps1
.git/
